      "id": "2119651966540456200",
      "text": "Clippers ride big offensive night, with 35-plus pts in final three quarters, to hand #Pelicans a rare convincing loss, by 139-123 margin. Trey Murphy 26 pts to lead New Orleans; Jeremiah Fears and Zion Williamson 25 pts each. Postgame wrap: https://t.co/xkErOvebE7 https://t.co/fsDEIcgEeL",
